    "source": "Christian Disciples Church — Sunday Gospel Channel on YouTube",
    "note": "Every recording is a YouTube video id. Nothing here is self-hosted any more, so the app carries no media and no subtitle files: YouTube supplies its own captions where they exist.",
    "pairingEvidence": "The language of each id was taken from YouTube's own title via oEmbed, NOT from the position of the embed on the church's page. Reading the page's layout put every Standing-at-the-Cross row one place out, which would have offered 'English' and played Cantonese.",
    "chineseTitles": "Chinese titles are stored once, under 'zh', exactly as the church wrote them. They are deliberately NOT converted between Simplified and Traditional — this is someone else's copy, and a converted glyph would be our word, not theirs.",
    "shemaNote": "The Shema series is the 29 links the church published — 25 numbered messages (#7-#31) plus the 4 whole-part compilations, which sit last within their own part. Ids and titles come from YouTube (oEmbed), not from the church page, which refuses datacenter IPs. Numbering starts at #7 because #1-#6 belong to a different series on the same channel and are deliberately not included. The church's bracketed sub-numbers are not shown: Part 4 reads (15)(16)(12)(18) where the sequence wants 17, and displaying a number we know to be wrong is worse than showing only the # that is consistent."
